$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=cnopnsn  LOC_AFTER=?

* The complex plane with one point removed is open.

s1::eqid |- ( TopOpen ` CCfld ) = ( TopOpen ` CCfld )
s2:s1:cnfldhaus |- ( TopOpen ` CCfld ) e. Haus
s3::unicntop |- CC = U. ( TopOpen ` CCfld )
s4:s3:sncld |- ( ( ( TopOpen ` CCfld ) e. Haus /\ P e. CC ) -> { P } e. ( Clsd ` ( TopOpen ` CCfld ) ) )
s5:s2:a1i |- ( P e. CC -> ( TopOpen ` CCfld ) e. Haus )
s6::id |- ( P e. CC -> P e. CC )
s7:s5,s6,s4:syl2anc |- ( P e. CC -> { P } e. ( Clsd ` ( TopOpen ` CCfld ) ) )
s8:s3:cldopn |- ( { P } e. ( Clsd ` ( TopOpen ` CCfld ) ) -> ( CC \ { P } ) e. ( TopOpen ` CCfld ) )
qed:s7,s8:syl |- ( P e. CC -> ( CC \ { P } ) e. ( TopOpen ` CCfld ) )
